<title>INDONESIA: Latest Indonesian election count.</title>
<headline>Latest Indonesian election count.</headline>
<dateline>JAKARTA 1997-06-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Following is the latest Indonesian election count with 110,280,292 ballots of a potential of 124.7 million issued at 4 a.m. Sunday (2200 GMT Saturday):</p>
<p>Ruling Golkar party:		  81,937,634 votes,  74.30 pct</p>
<p>United Development Party (PPP):   24,978,402 votes,  22.64 pct</p>
<p>Indonesian Democratic Party (PDI): 3,364,256 votes,   3.05 pct</p>
<p>Percentage results in Jakarta:</p>
<p>Golkar: 58.30 pct PPP:    39.72 pct</p>
<p>PDI:     1.96 pct</p>
</text>
